# Allowlist of scripts/check-no-public-network-in-tests.py: test-source lines that name a public
# server or a non-local address but do no I/O with it.
#
#   <path> | <count> | <text the line contains> | <reason>
#
# The row allows exactly <count> flagged lines of <path> containing the text: one more fails (a
# new line under an old row), one fewer fails (a stale row). A line that does reach off the
# machine never belongs here: fix the test (a server on loopback in the same process).
